      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Mixed-ability badminton: a close score is not the whole definition of a good game</h1>
      <p class="lede">Put your best player with your newest player against the second-best and second-newest and the arithmetic may say “perfectly balanced”. Then watch the two strong players conduct a singles match around their partners.</p>
